{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "storage",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## idea.quest\nProject records, decisions and progress.\nSelected project stays synced across all views.",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "chief",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Chief of Staff\nCoordinate the next useful step.\nAll six roles load the shared identity, voice, rules and skill.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "key",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Current checks\nAll six roles returned live fixture replies.\n15 workflow checks passed.\nNative menu and identity: confirmed by Vihaan.\nDefense and submission remain open.\n[[../Project-03/agent-status]]",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "goal",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1. Approve goal\nReview the concrete goal and success criteria.\nAgents cannot approve it.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "pip",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Pip (Design Shelf)\nProject-aware, licensed reusable assets.\nReal previews. One home category per asset.",
      "x": -460,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "cloud",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Sunday cloud collection\n10 starting picks per category.\nUp to 5 replace the oldest 5 weekly.\nPublic assets only; works while PC is off.",
      "x": -960,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "refs",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Approve references and hand off\nSaving is not approval.\nOnly the approved snapshot reaches Creative Partner.",
      "x": -460,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "creative",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Creative Partner\nDirections and interaction choices.\nUses approved references only.",
      "x": -220,
      "y": 950,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "tech",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Technologist\nCheck facts, compare routes, propose a small test.\nThe user chooses the route.",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "route",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2. Approve route\nDirection, references, technical route and small test.\nA route choice alone is not a full build.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1190,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "build",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Programmer\nStage only the agreed browser prototype.\nNo original-source edit or publication.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "apply",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Review files and Apply\nSeparate review action within the cycle.\nFiles go in the run folder.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1670,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "prototype",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3. Accept prototype\nTry the sandboxed result.\nAccept, revise or reject it.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1910,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "auditor",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Auditor\nReview actual files and supplied syntax checks.\nUnrun interactions remain unknown.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2150,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "failure",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Failed required check\nStop. Show the evidence.\nRequest a fix, revisit the plan, or pause.",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 2150,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "human",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4. Human check\nTry unknown checks and write what happened.\nAuditor never replaces this step.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2390,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "decide",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5. Continue or stop\nContinue: new cycle. Stop: save outcome and limits.\nOld class approvals stay separate.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2630,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 155,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "context",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Context boundary\nAgents run on PC Codex.\nRaw notes, credentials and other chats stay outside Pip.\nSelection messages never carry approvals.",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "saved-progress",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Saved class progress\n![[AI 101/Project 2/progress.md]]\n\nSeparate from the selected Workshop cycle.",
      "x": -470,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
